              is a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fixed+point"} fixed point
              of the function.
          %p In general, an identity function is an element of this type. However, any element of the type of identity functions is unique up to identification:
          %p
          .num_theorem
            %h6 Theorem
            %p
              For all types
              = succeed "," do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
