                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \lambda x:A.\mathrm{ap}(i, i(x), x, I(x)) \bullet I(x):\prod_{x:A} i(i(x)) =_A x
            %p
              which indicates that the identity function
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
